# Sample world for the competency-question tests. Every fact has an answer that a person worked out by
# hand; tests/cq/*.expected.json states it. The sample is deliberately small:
#
#   P1  in force at USPTO; four executed grants (one exclusive, one expired, two co-exclusive with cap 2);
#       one open proposed grant from another party
#   P2  USPTO says lapsed in 2019; the NASA dataset still shows a nominal expiration in 2027
#   P3  no USPTO record, no expiration date, but a filing date
#   P4  ownership complete with no co-owners (an explicit negative fact); export unrestricted
#   P5  two co-owners, one has consented; export restricted to US and CA
#   P6  ownership record is incomplete
#   P7  no ownership record and no export classification (unknown, not "none")
#   P8  an exclusive grant that a later correction supersedes

ex:runBulk a gng:BulkLoad ; prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-24T18:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .
<https://w3id.org/gonogo/synth/generator/v0.1> a gng:SyntheticGeneration ;
    gng:generatorSeed 42 ; prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-24T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <https://w3id.org/gonogo/synth/generator> .
<https://w3id.org/gonogo/synth/generator> a gng:Generator .

